"description": "Temenos AG is a holding company, which engages in the business of developing, marketing, and selling integrated banking software systems. It operates under the Product and Services segments. The Product segment includes marketing, licensing, and maintaining software solutions including software development fees for requested functionality and providing hosting and subscription arrangements. The Services segment focuses on various implementation tasks such as consulting and training. The company was founded by George Koukis in 1993 and is headquartered in Grand-Lancy, Switzerland.",
